          "text": "Díaz-Balart has sought bipartisan immigration solutions and supported Trump's travel ban. In 2026, he cosponsored the DIGNIDAD Act proposing a pathway to legal status for up to 12 million illegal immigrants paired with stricter border enforcement."
        },
